st+=sec('1. Product purpose and feature story')
st += [P('The approved project frames DaGoal as a gamified daily activity planner intended to help users reduce excessive screen time by replacing passive use with physical, mental, and creative activities. The code implements generated and custom quests, progression/rewards, optional step tracking, and user-started screen-avoidance quests.'),P('Defense-ready purpose statement','H2x'),P('“The main purpose of DaGoal is to encourage users to reduce excessive screen time by replacing passive digital consumption with productive real-world activities. It generates daily quests informed by user preferences and supports follow-through with flexible task choices, progress tracking, XP, gold, streaks, achievements, and avatar rewards. Our initial study evaluated functionality and user perceptions after a three-day trial; it does not establish long-term screen-time reduction.”','Callout'),P('Explain the design in three layers','H2x'),bullet('<b>Goal layer:</b> personalized daily quests across physical, mental, and creative activities, alongside custom/recurring quests.'),bullet('<b>Tracking layer:</b> manual confirmation, repetition/count progress, timed avoidance, and sensor-supported step tracking.'),bullet('<b>Motivation layer:</b> XP/gold, levels, streaks, achievements, consumables, cosmetic shop items, and avatar customization.'),P('The manuscript describes selected-app blocking. The current code starts an avoidance timer and monitors foreground-app usage, then shows an interruption overlay with options. Describe that observed implementation accurately; do not promise an OS-level hard block.','Callout'),P('2. User journey','H1x'),HRFlowable(width='100%',thickness=1,color=SURFACE,spaceAfter=7)]
journey=[('Launch','LoadingActivity prepares the local database and preloads some app/avatar assets. It routes returning users to dashboard or daily reveal, and new users to the welcome flow.'),('Entry','MainActivity provides guest avatar creation and a route to login/authentication options.'),('Set up','AvatarCreationActivity customizes the avatar. ProfilingActivity collects onboarding questionnaire answers/profile data. AppSelectionActivity lets users choose apps for avoidance monitoring.'),('Daily start','DailyRevealActivity is used when the app detects that a new day’s quests need to be generated/revealed.'),('Use','DashboardActivity hosts Quest, Wardrobe, Shop, and Me sections. Users complete quests, manage items/avatar, and inspect progress.'),('Support','SettingsActivity covers account, notification, privacy/permissions, sound, and about settings; StreakActivity and StreakInfoActivity display streak details.')]
rows=[[P('Stage','TH'),P('What to say','TH')]]+[[P(a,'TB'),P(b,'TB')] for a,b in journey]
st += [make_table(rows,[1.1*inch,5.2*inch]),Spacer(1,7),P('Short user-flow explanation','H2x'),P('“A new user enters through the welcome/authentication flow or starts as a guest, customizes an avatar, answers onboarding questions, and can select apps for avoidance quests. On later launches, the app prepares the day’s quests and opens the dashboard. Completing quests updates progress and rewards, while the other dashboard sections support avatar items, shop purchases, achievements, and profile/streak review.”','Callout'),PageBreak()]

st+=sec('3. Activities and components: what each one does','Use "Activity" to mean an Android screen/controller. Some product areas are dashboard views rather than separate Activities; say that distinction accurately.')
acts=[('LoadingActivity','Startup coordinator: initializes/opens the local database, preloads assets, checks onboarding/login/guest state, and routes to the next screen.'),('MainActivity','Welcome/entry screen. Offers guest avatar creation and login navigation.'),('AuthOptionsActivity','Presents available authentication choices.'),('AuthEmailActivity','Email-based authentication flow, including sign-in/registration paths.'),('AuthPasswordActivity','Password entry/authentication step and Firebase Auth sign-in handling.'),('SignUpActivity','Creates an account through Firebase Authentication and initializes selected cloud profile data.'),('AvatarCreationActivity','Lets users customize avatar features/colors, renders a preview/snapshot, saves avatar configuration locally, and merges selected avatar fields to Firestore for an account.'),('ProfilingActivity','Runs the onboarding questionnaire, records answers/preferences and profile information locally, and syncs selected profile state when signed in.'),('AppSelectionActivity','Allows selection of installed apps for avoidance-related quests; explain usage-access and package-visibility requirements carefully.'),('DailyRevealActivity','Daily quest introduction/reveal screen, entered when a new daily quest set is due.'),('DashboardActivity','Primary workspace hosting Quest, Wardrobe, Shop, and Me areas, quest interactions, progression summaries, and navigation.'),('StreakActivity','Shows a daily streak popup/summary and streak-related prompt.'),('StreakInfoActivity','Displays streak history/calendar information and related prediction/chest details.'),('SettingsActivity','Account, notification, privacy/permissions, sound/haptics, and about controls; includes account management actions.')]
rows=[[P('Activity','TH'),P('Defense-ready purpose','TH')]]+[[P(a,'TB'),P(b,'TB')] for a,b in acts]
st += [make_table(rows,[1.6*inch,4.7*inch]),Spacer(1,6),P('<b>Services and helpers:</b> StepTrackingService listens to Android step sensors and updates step quest progress; AppMonitorService polls usage stats while avoidance quests are active; AvoidanceOverlayManager displays interruption/ignore UI; TaskManager contains quest generation, progress, completion, reward, streak, and related logic; DatabaseHelper creates/upgrades/seeds SQLite; DailyNotificationReceiver handles daily/reminder/boot events.','Callout'),PageBreak()]

st+=sec('4. Core logic and data flow')
st += [P('Daily quest generation','H2x'),P('TaskManager checks the date and streak state, preserves due recurring custom quests, determines quest slots from level (three base slots, one added per five levels, capped at ten), may include an avoidance quest when blocked apps exist, then fills remaining slots from survey-driven or other templates. Generated quests can vary by user state and random choices; do not promise an identical fixed list.'),P('Quest completion and progression','H2x'),P('When a quest is completed, TaskManager reads its stored reward, marks it complete, applies an active XP/gold boost if enabled, updates local gold and XP, calculates level-ups using configured thresholds, grants level-up rewards where applicable, and updates achievement/chest counters. The dashboard refreshes the visible state. Avoid citing a specific formula unless checked in the current implementation or demo build.'),P('Step quest flow','H2x'),P('User grants activity-recognition permission → StepTrackingService runs as a foreground service with a persistent notification → sensor readings are converted to a daily step count → TaskManager updates a matching step quest → progress appears on the dashboard. This depends on compatible device sensors and permissions.'),P('Avoidance quest flow','H2x'),P('User selects apps. If a daily avoidance quest is generated, DashboardActivity asks for Usage Access and overlay permission. The user starts the quest; AppMonitorService then checks recent foreground app usage and may show an interruption overlay. The user can leave, choose a timed ignore with reduced reward, or stop/reset the quest. This is opt-in Android monitoring, not a universal system-level blocker.'),P('Storage and cloud boundary','H2x')]
rows=[[P('Data/service','TH'),P('Role in this build','TH')],[P('SQLite (DatabaseHelper)','TB'),P('Primary structured local store: user progression, daily quests, templates, inventory, consumables, achievements, blocked apps, preferences, and streak history.','TB')],[P('SharedPreferences','TB'),P('Local flags/settings such as onboarding state, daily generation date, and selected preferences.','TB')],[P('Firebase Authentication','TB'),P('Email account registration/sign-in flows. Guest use is also supported by local state.','TB')],[P('Cloud Firestore','TB'),P('Selected account/profile/avatar/streak sync and online shop/chest functions are present. Do not claim the entire local quest database is cloud-backed without confirming a sync implementation.','TB')]]
