rapid=[('What class contains daily quest/business logic?','TaskManager.'),('What screen hosts the four main product areas?','DashboardActivity: Quest, Wardrobe, Shop, and Me.'),('What is the primary structured local database?','SQLite through DatabaseHelper/SQLiteOpenHelper.'),('Which service tracks steps?','StepTrackingService.'),('Which service monitors selected app usage?','AppMonitorService, with AvoidanceOverlayManager for interruption UI.'),('Does source code prove the app improves habits?','No. That requires empirical evaluation.'),('Is all data in Firebase?','No. Primary app state is local; Firebase handles auth and selected cloud features.'),('What is a known data-upgrade concern?','DatabaseHelper.onUpgrade drops/recreates daily_tasks and task_templates.')]
